<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Yea, let none that wait on Thee be ashamed,</l><l>Yea, let none that wait on Thee be ashamed</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Show me Thy ways, teach me Thy paths,</l><l>Show me Thy ways, teach me Thy paths</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Remember not the sins of my youth,</l><l>Remember not the sins of my youth</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>All the paths of the Lord are mercy and truth,</l><l>All the paths of the Lord are mercy and truth</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>What man is he that feareth the Lord?</l><l>What man is he that feareth the Lord?</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>The secret of the Lord is with them that fear Him,</l><l>The secret of the Lord is with them that fear Him</l></lg>
<lg label="8."><l>Turn Thee unto me and have mercy upon me,</l><l>Turn Thee unto me and have mercy upon me</l></lg>
<lg label="9."><l>O keep my soul and deliver me,</l><l>O keep my soul and deliver me</l></lg>
<lg label="10."><l>Let integrity and uprightness preserve me,</l><l>Let integrity and uprightness preserve me</l></lg>
<lg label="11."><l>Redeem Israel, O God, out of all his troubles,</l><l>Redeem Israel, O God, out of all his troubles</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
